        Standardization of Psychiatric Diagnoses -- Role of Fine-tuned <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLM</span> Consortium and OpenAI-gpt-oss Reasoning <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLM</span> Enabled Decision Support System
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
