    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Reflections on the Reproducibility of Commercial <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLM</span> Performance in Empirical Software Engineering Studies
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Angermeir%2C+F">Florian Angermeir</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Amougou%2C+M">Maximilian Amougou</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kreitz%2C+M">Mark Kreitz</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Bauer%2C+A">Andreas Bauer</a>, 
      
