    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Small Talk, Big Impact? <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLM</span>-based Conversational Agents to Mitigate Passive Fatigue in Conditional Automated Driving
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
