    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Purushothama%2C+A">Abhishek Purushothama</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Min%2C+J">Junghyun Min</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Waldon%2C+B">Brandon Waldon</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Schneider%2C+N">Nathan Schneider</a>
      
